# "Return all attacking creatures to their owner's hand.": on turn 3 Bot1 attacks with Hero of Bladehold and an Ornithopter,
# keeping a second Ornithopter home. Hero's trigger puts two Soldier tokens onto the battlefield attacking; once both Soldiers
# are there Bot2 casts Aetherize. Every attacker goes back to its owner's hand - Hero, the attacking Ornithopter and (CR 111.7)
# the tokens, which cease to exist rather than reach a hand - while the Ornithopter that did not attack, and Bot2's own
# non-attacking Ornithopter, stay (CR 506.4: only creatures attacking this combat). Nobody is dealt combat damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Hero of Bladehold
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Aetherize
Ornithopter
Plains
Island x20

